     1971       price-rubl-without-tax-loc  = price-rubl-with-tax-loc  - vat-rubl-loc  - slt-rubl-loc  - ((if road-tax-rubl-loc  = ? then 0 else road-tax-rubl-loc) + (if transport-rubl-loc = ? then 0 else transport-rubl-loc) + (if other-rubl-loc = ? then 0 else other-rubl-loc))
     1972   .
